Package: AMRvalid
Title: Population-Aware Evaluation of Antimicrobial Resistance Predictions
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R:
    person("Md Omar", "Faruqe", , "faruqe@ru.ac.bd", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1226-7226"))
Description: Evaluates externally generated antimicrobial resistance (AMR)
    phenotype predictions against phenotypic reference results. Provides a
    documented data contract, input validation, species-antimicrobial
    stratified classification metrics, antimicrobial susceptibility testing
    agreement metrics (categorical agreement, very major, major and minor
    errors, essential agreement) and interval estimates suitable for small
    denominators. Models are not trained inside the package.
